Usage: agent-deck group <command> [options]

Commands:
  list              List all groups with session counts
  show <name>       Show one group; --resolved adds the effective claude config (alias: info)
  create <name>     Create a new group
  update <name>     Update group settings
  delete <name>     Delete a group (aliases: rm, remove)
  move <id> <group> Move session to a different group
  change <group> [<dest>] Reparent a group (empty dest = move to root)
  reorder <name>    Reorder a group (--up, --down, --position N)

Examples:
  agent-deck group list
  agent-deck group show work --resolved        # Verify the effective [groups."work".claude] config
  agent-deck group create mobile
  agent-deck group create ios --parent mobile
  agent-deck group update mobile --default-path /path/to/repo
  agent-deck group delete experiments
  agent-deck group delete work --force
  agent-deck group move my-project work/frontend
  agent-deck group move my-project ""          # Move to root
  agent-deck group change project1 work         # Move group 'project1' under 'work'
  agent-deck group change work/project1          # Move 'work/project1' to root
  agent-deck group reorder mobile --up
  agent-deck group reorder mobile --down
  agent-deck group reorder mobile --position 0
